{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an apple. <br>No, not a metaphor. You are truly an apple. <br>Red, shiny, vibrant skin; full and ripe inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no movement in this game. No jumping. No enemies. <br>You simply exist. You stay still. You think. <br>You\u2019re being watched\u2026 perhaps studied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, the play of light paints your skin in shifting colors. <br>But still, you remain\u2026 just an apple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And maybe, that means more than you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can being an apple be a game? <br>Can stillness be an action? <br>Can being observed be a challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe it can. <br>And this game exists for exactly that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We leave you with just one question: <br>Can you truly remain\u2026 an apple?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Apple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2634380/59e79aabd197e7258112ca96254e9f2776636263.jpg"},{"name":"Bronze Apple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2634380/298b9185b8223bc5888f3a21b8e1d8030fac9a0b.jpg"},{"name":"Iron Apple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2634380/5e832b56a9c2e6880eaa06bb65de8bb617fa8aa0.jpg"},{"name":"Silver Apple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2634380/3d2ff180f59562b4ac796883c9ee31e798e9b728.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Apple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2634380/31690fb48dc981a416e2db9c773ad1f42b13b682.jpg"},{"name":"Diamond Apple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2634380/19d7a3a00508d42d3ca7a93c37e83f35f1710460.jpg"},{"name":"Jade Apple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2634380/743d687d54492c718e203b790a239ad9840fba94.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2634380?t=1749728536","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2634380?t=1749728536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634380/544e87168fac696ffd4c0ab3a7479d01cacd793a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749728536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634380/544e87168fac696ffd4c0ab3a7479d01cacd793a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749728536","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an apple. <br>No, not a metaphor. You are truly an apple. <br>Red, shiny, vibrant skin; full and ripe inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no movement in this game. No jumping. No enemies. <br>You simply exist. You stay still. You think. <br>You\u2019re being watched\u2026 perhaps studied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, the play of light paints your skin in shifting colors. <br>But still, you remain\u2026 just an apple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And maybe, that means more than you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can being an apple be a game? <br>Can stillness be an action? <br>Can being observed be a challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe it can. <br>And this game exists for exactly that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We leave you with just one question: <br>Can you truly remain\u2026 an apple?</p>","developers":["Kagan \u00d6r\u00fcn"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st